        "locator": "L380-L396 (v2.14 to 3.0 › Other changes › Empty Environment Variables in Plugins)",
        "excerpt": "### Empty Environment Variables in Plugins\n\nIn Argo CD 3.0, empty environment variables are now passed to config management plugins.\n\n```yaml\napiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nspec:\n  source:\n    plugin:\n      name: example-plugin\n      env:\n        - name: VERSION\n          value: '1.2.3'\n        - name: DATA # Even though this is empty, it will be passed to the plugin as ARGOCD_ENV_DATA=\"\".\n          value: ''\n```",
